  "fluff": {
    "overview": "<p>Clan field gun Points crew light-caliber LB-X autocannons with dual-munition capability. Clan-manufactured LB-X weapons benefit from superior Clan engineering tolerances, and the crews can switch between solid slugs for armored targets and cluster rounds for dispersed enemies. Within the Touman, field gun assignments fall to freeborn or solahma warriors tasked with area defense, providing direct fire support that frees front-line Stars for offensive operations.</p>"
